V1-0 10 July 2000 CB:
---------------------
  - tidy up src directory:
    remove config_hkbaja47.h config_mv167_16MB.h config_mv167_32MB.h 
    dhstests.c epToVxLib2.c global_edit makeLint simpleLog2.c wfsDb2.c 
